  abilityDesc: 49 combo massive Dark attack on all foes (partial HP absorption),
    inflicts elemental vulnerability infliction for 3 turns, adds all elements to
    attack for 3 turns, enormously boosts all elemental damage for 3 turns & enormously
    reduces damage taken from all types for 2 turns
